  "comments": "<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">BU 1999 - 2001</span></span></span><br />\r\nSet introduction of the euro with coins from 1999 to 2001<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\"> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/63936acc26541.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/63936acc26541.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"111\" /></a></span><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">BU 2002</span></span></span><br />\r\n1 - Annual boxed set - 100,000 gold spurs + 1 medal (700 years of the battle of the gold spurs: 1302 - 2002)<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f7b5544c8ffc.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f7b5544c8ffc.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"103\" /></a><br />\r\n2 - Farewell to the franc, welcome to the euro, 20,000 copies<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f7b5552d0539.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f7b5552d0539.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"143\" /></a><br />\r\n3 - Road cycling CM, 20,000 copies<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">image to be found</span><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">BU 2003</span></span></span><br />\r\n1 - 50 years of TV in Belgium + 1 medal (50 years of TV in Belgium) 100,000 copies<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f7b515bcda37.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f7b515bcda37.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"250\" /></a><br />\r\n2- 100 years of Ford, 15,000 copies<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">image to be found</span><br />\r\n3 - Birth, 10,000 copies<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">image to be found</span><br />\r\n4 - Wedding, 10,000 copies<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">image to be found</span><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">BU 2004</span></span></span><br />\r\n1 - 140 years of the Red Cross 60,000 copies + 1 classic medal<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f7b5dba80e18.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f7b5dba80e18.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"111\" /></a><br />\r\n2 - 140 years of the Red Cross + 1 medal with the cross painted red, 2,000 copies<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">image to be found</span><br />\r\n3 - Birth, 10,000 copies<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">image to be found</span><br />\r\n4 - Wedding 10,000 copies<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">image to be found</span><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">BU 2005</span></span></span><br />\r\n1 - Grand' Place + 1 medal uncolored 38 000 copies<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f7b609c5a7fa.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f7b609c5a7fa.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"94\" /></a><br />\r\n2 - Grand' Place + 1 medal colorized, 2,000 copies<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">image to be found</span><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">BU 2006</span></span></span><br />\r\n1 - Flemish Beguinages + 1 medal uncolored 38 000 copies<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f7b61958ae38.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f7b61958ae38.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"105\" /></a><br />\r\n2 - Flemish Beguinages + 1 medal colorized at 2,000 copies<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">image to be found</span>",
